    },
    {
      "zh": "两个对手都沿固定路线走，遇到零件就花一回合拾取。抢同一个零件时，优先顺序每回合轮换。",
      "en": "Both rivals follow fixed routes and spend a turn picking up each part they reach. Pickup priority rotates each turn."
    }
  ],
